  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-03-23T15:27:45.448Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Good morning, everyone. I’ve seen a significant issue where groups are setting up an event in collaboration with another community and are left deciding what group will be running the instance. This makes it very difficult to get members from the community/s not running the instance to join the event. So, I propose a new instance type called “collab instance,” where groups can share a group instance or at least where the instance can be advertised in each other's groups.",
